---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions - AI Online Protractor"
  description="Terms and Conditions of Use for AI Online Protractor (aionlineprotractor.com). Read our acceptable use policy, intellectual property rights, and engineering disclaimers."
  canonical="https://aionlineprotractor.com/terms"
  currentPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500">
        Legal Agreement
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mt-1">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">Effective Date: September 11, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm space-y-8 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      <!-- 1. Acceptance of Terms -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <strong>AI Online Protractor</strong> (available at <a href="https://aionlineprotractor.com" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">https://aionlineprotractor.com</a>), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue use of the service immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Permitted Use & License -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">2. Permitted Use & License</h2>
        <p>
          We grant you a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to use the online protractors, angle calculators, inclinometers, and image analysis tools for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li>Personal, educational, and homework measurement purposes.</li>
          <li>Commercial drafting, architectural planning, woodworking, and engineering design.</li>
          <li>Classroom projections and instructional demonstrations by teachers and educators.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>Restrictions:</strong> You may not scrape, frame, reverse-engineer, distribute, or sell the software code, algorithms, or visual assets of this website without prior express written consent from the website owners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Accuracy & Engineering Disclaimer -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">3. Accuracy & Engineering Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          While our vector math calculations are based on exact trigonometric algorithms (θ = atan2(Δy, Δx)), real-world measurement accuracy can be influenced by physical device factors:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li>Display aspect ratios and non-square physical pixel pitches.</li>
          <li>Smartphone camera lens optical barrel/pincushion distortion.</li>
          <li>Mobile accelerometer / gyroscope calibration offsets.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Therefore, AI Online Protractor is provided for informational, instructional, and drafting assistance. <strong>Measurements should always be verified using certified calibrated physical instruments for safety-critical construction, structural engineering, or medical surgery.</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Intellectual Property -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">4. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>
          All trademarks, logos, UI designs, graphics, and computer algorithms on AI Online Protractor are the intellectual property of the site operators and protected by international copyright and trademark laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Third-Party Services & Links -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">5. Third-Party Services & External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to external third-party websites or services (including advertising networks like Google AdSense). We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or accuracy of third-party websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Limitation of Liability -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, in no event shall AI Online Protractor, its creators, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, punitive, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the tools on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Modifications to Service and Terms -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">7. Modifications to Service and Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any part of the service, or update these Terms & Conditions at any time without prior notice. Continued use of the website following changes indicates acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 8. Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">8. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For legal inquiries or questions regarding these Terms & Conditions, please reach out:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 text-xs font-mono space-y-1">
          <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://aionlineprotractor.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">https://aionlineprotractor.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> hello@aionlineprotractor.com</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
